  Sorry, but I find that a bizarre statement.  To me that is like saying
"how can gunka2 be inherent if the worker finishes the task and moves on to
a different task" or "how can cusku2 be inherent if the speaker says
something else?"  They are inherent properties of a given train at a given
space/time, just like any other terbri.

